Mid-presentation Requirement:

Dataset introduction & motivation:
* Dataset source, size, and features.
* Why this dataset was chosen and its relevance to project goals.
* Dataset complexity (messiness, preprocessing needs, richness for analysis).

Data cleaning/processing:
* Handling of missing values, outliers, transformations, merging, etc.
