Preliminary ML direction:
* Proposed ML task (classification, regression, clustering).
* Justification based on EDA insights (e.g., categorical imbalance → classification with resampling).
* No results required yet.

Dashboard Requirements
* Each group presents one dashboard created by one student.
* Dashboard may use any visualization tools introduced up to that point

